Package: custompals
Title: Custom Color Palettes for Plotting
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Toshitha", "Kannan", , "toshithakannan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A personal collection of custom color palettes, with helper
    functions to retrieve them as discrete or continuous color vectors and
    ggplot2 scale functions for direct use in plots.
